          "quote": "a closer investigation with back-scatter electron (BSE) detection (Fig. 2b) shows a secondary phase of thickness ⁓66 ± 34 nm formed on the grain boundaries of the HIP microstructure. The secondary grain-boundary phase was not present in the as-cast microstructure (Fig. 2a). An energy dispersive spectroscopy (EDS) line scan across the grain-boundary phase (Fig. 2c,d) reveals significantly higher O content and the depletion of Mo, Ta, and W elements. The grain-boundary phase consists of Nb (~20–23 at.%) and O (⁓62–64 at.%) with a small amount of other metallic constituents",
